    "image_prompt": "Editorial tech thumbnail 16:9: a marketer's hand letting go of a control lever while an automated dashboard redistributes budget across Facebook, Instagram and Reels placements, amber (#c8922a) accents on a dark background, retro pixel dot texture, hard 3px corners, solid offset pixel shadows, no text, no logos.",
    "faq_items": [
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "h3",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Is Advantage+ better than manual Meta campaigns?",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Not always. Meta's own tests report lower costs with Advantage+ features turned on, but independent data has shown new-customer costs rising on Advantage+ campaigns. The only reliable answer for your account is a side-by-side test measured on cost per new customer.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "h3",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "What happened to Advantage+ shopping campaigns?",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "In February 2025 Meta renamed Advantage+ shopping campaigns to Advantage+ sales campaigns and extended the same automation to leads campaigns, while testing a simpler setup that no longer asks you to choose between manual and Advantage+ at the start.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "h3",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Do I still need audiences with Advantage+?",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "You need fewer of them. Keep hard limits where the law or your business requires them, exclude existing customers when you want new buyers, and upload customer lists so the system learns from real purchases. Interest stacking adds little.",
